  "description": "The SCOTT Spark DC 30 is built for riders who want more from every ride. A short-travel platform that brings together cross-country speed and downhill confidence—equally at home on local singletrack as it is on backcountry missions.\n\nEvery detail is considered to deliver stability and responsiveness. A low center of mass keeps the ride controlled and planted through flow trails and jump lines. Paired with 140mm front and 138mm rear travel, it provides the range to handle technical terrain and rougher features with ease. The lightweight HMF carbon frame is tuned for cross-country efficiency on the climbs and lively, spirited performance on the descents—a balance of speed and capability that makes every ride rewarding.\n\nTraction, control, and comfort are delivered by RockShox's Pike Select fork and Deluxe Traction shock, both with a custom tune that keeps your wheels planted and your options open for whatever the trail presents. From lunch laps and focused sessions to full weekend adventures, the suspension is engineered to elevate the ride at every turn.\n\nThe component spec rounds out a capable, considered, and performance-driven package. SRAM's S1000 Eagle AXS Transmission drivetrain delivers smooth, reliable riding across every condition, while integrated frame storage and a dedicated frame mount make it straightforward to load up for bikepacking and keeping essentials close on longer rides.\n\nPerformance also extends to practicality. Improved serviceability and tunability are built into the design, making it easy to keep the bike dialed and riding exactly how you like it—so you spend less time in the workshop and more time focused on the trail ahead.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
